algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm BoundedMemorySolve(F, P):
    retained <- empty
    for i = 1 to m:
        retained <- (B_i intersect F) union frontier(i)
        for each assignment sigma of vars(retained):
            if sigma satisfies all clauses in retained:
                record sigma as locally consistent
        if no locally consistent assignment exists:
            return UNSAT
    if all stages composable: return SAT
    else: return UNSAT

Complexity: Memory O(k), Time O(m * 2^((k+1)*l))
